# x-migrate-adopt-core core wire

file: native/core/crates/mixdog-core-domains/Cargo.toml
place: [dependencies], after `mixdog-js = { workspace = true }`
add: mixdog-migrate = { workspace = true }
note: mixdog-migrate does not depend on mixdog-core-domains (its deps are core-api, agent, js, mcp, store, statefile, ledger, protocol, ...), so no cycle. Then `cargo update --workspace --offline` / hakari as usual.

file: native/core/crates/mixdog-core-domains/Cargo.toml
