add: mixdog-migrate = { workspace = true, features = ["crash-hook"] }
note: the test-feature unification every crate that builds mixdog-migrate in its tests carries (D:\mixdog-build\tools\unify-test-features.py).

file: native/core/crates/mixdog-core-domains/src/domains/mod.rs
place: the `pub mod` list, after `pub mod instructions;`
add: pub mod migrate_profile;

file: native/core/crates/mixdog-app-server-daemon/src/compose_flip.rs
place: fn real_core, after `builder.register(workspace.clone() as Arc<dyn mixdog_core_api::service::DomainService>)?;` (`mixdog_home` is the `let` that computes `MIXDOG_HOME`, else `~/.mixdog`: the `<H>` boot.rs's migration_roots resolves through mixdog_migrate::run::cli::resolve_roots; `b.data_dir` is its `<D>`)
